<title>USA: U.S. DAP prices higher, ammonia down.</title>
<headline>U.S. DAP prices higher, ammonia down.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. cash diammonium phosphate prices were stronger on Friday while ammonia values were weaker.</p>
<p>DAP was up on tight supply while ammonia weakened on poor international and domestic demand, a dealer said.</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>			    Dlrs/short ton	  Chg from Wednesday</p>
<p>DAP central Fla	   178-180			up 5</p>
<p>DAP central La Gulf     184-186			up 4</p>
<p>Ammonia/La Gulf	   220-225			dn 5</p>
<p>--(Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720)</p>
